  "summary": "I added pause to src/main.ts and it typechecks. I didn't render it or press P in a browser. P toggles pause while the game is `playing`. While paused, the slab, falling pieces and camera all stop, and both Space and canvas clicks are ignored. P does nothing once the game is `won` or `lost`. R restarts and also clears the pause. The HUD shows \"Paused\" in yellow next to the status while paused. `window.__TASK_STATE__` now includes `paused: boolean`, and `status` stays `playing` during a pause."
